      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2017. Published by Elsevier B.V.",
        "AbstractText": "The Italian Society for Pure and Applied Biophysics (SIBPA) held its XXIII National Congress in the gorgeous Tuscan town of Cortona, Italy, on September 18-21, 2016. This special issue features a selection of contributions from the Congress in the areas of molecular, applied, cellular and computational biophysics. Cutting-edge developments in nanoscale biophysics were introduced for the first time in the program. SIBPA continues its successful promotion of biophysical disciplines at the national and international levels, with added strength from its partnership with Biophysical Chemistry and Elsevier."
      },
